message: >-
  If you use this guide or its scripts, please cite it as below. This does not replace the citation and
  acknowledgement of ADNI required by the ADNI Data Use Agreement.
type: software
title: "ADNI download guide: how to download the ADNI dataset from LONI IDA, with helper scripts"
abstract: >-
  A step-by-step guide to downloading ADNI clinical tables and MRI/PET images from the LONI Image & Data Archive,
  with dependency-free helper scripts to select one image per visit, download and test ZIPs, index the images and
  convert them to BIDS.
